The task does not specify any text for the link that returns to the home page, but the test asserts:
```ts
const homeLink = document.querySelector('a[href="/"]');
expect(homeLink).toBeInTheDocument();
expect(homeLink).toHaveTextContent(/home/i);
```

The specification never requires each training‑course card to have a `data-testid="training-course-card"`, yet the test relies on it:
```ts
const cards = screen.getAllByTestId('training-course-card');
expect(cards).toHaveLength(trainingCourses.length);
```
